      "message": "chore: update igd-next to 0.18 (#6664)\n\n## Description\n\n\n\nUpdates igd-next to 0.18.0.\n\npossibly resolves #6243.\n\n## AI Assistance Disclosure\n\n\n\n**Tools used** _(required — write `none` if no AI was used)_: _e.g. none / Claude Code / Copilot / Cursor / ChatGPT_\n\n**Attestation** _(required)_:\n\n- [x] I have read every line of this diff, understand what it does, and can explain it in review.\n\n## Notes & open questions\n\n\n\nWhile this update *might* resolve #6243, further testing would need to be done (though it might be worth looking into implementing PMP/PCP in the near future as well). Additionally, this update introduces some optimizations, fixes, does allow us to remove a dependency from the tree. \n\n## Change checklist\n\n\n\n- [ ] I have performed a self-review of my own code\n- [ ] I have made corresponding changes to the documentation\n- [ ] I have added tests that prove my fix is effective or that my feature works\n- [ ] A changelog entry has been made in the appropriate crates\n\n\nApproved-by: jxs <1204690+jxs@users.noreply.github.com>",
